OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FEarly
OL,6,Fevening showers easing to leave a
OL,7,Fmostly dry night with clear spells.
OL,8,FWinds also easing a little by morning,
OL,9,Fwith temperatures falling into the
OL,10,Fsingle figures in the countryside.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FDry at first, but increasingly
OL,13,Fcloudy as rain moves in from the west
OL,14,Fduring the morning. Turning heavy for
OL,15,Fa time, especially over western hills.
OL,16,FRather windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
