OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy on Saturday with patchy rain
OL,7,Fand stronger winds. Drier and brighter
OL,8,Fto the east of high ground on Sunday.
OL,9,FWarmer on Monday with lighter winds
OL,10,Fbut rather cloudy.
